      "type": "moment"
    },
    {
      "content": "Okay. Okay, gotcha. So, in that case what we generally do which is normally the quickest and most efficient is once the move is finished, we generally just call like right then after the move is done and then just take the payment over the phone. There's also an option to send over an invoice which, you know, just kinda, it's a little bit more of a process but you should because we have it happened all the time so we usually just call after the move is done and then they just pay over the phone. Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah, super, super easy.",
